  "details": "I'm not exactly sure what caused this but recently after my Quest 3 updated (V79.1031) my head IK has been doing these jerky movements.\n\nThis occurs on 3pt tracking and 6pt tracking with Hips and Head spine mode locked.\n\nIn the GIF I'm only looking straight up and straight down and you can see the extra rotations.\n\nAlthough when I move really slow I can do a normal nod\n\nThis movement happens to every avatar I try on.\n\nHas this happened to anyone else?",
